        <profile name="Bladevanes" id="f27e-4e8b-1b11-b1c7" hidden="false" typeId="456a-26d9-cb27-bd5c" typeName="Wargear">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9e5e-2cfd-7c93-749a">When moving with Turbo Boosters, a Reaver unit may slash its foes with its bladevanes. Mark the start and end points of the unit&apos;s move, and trace an imaginary line between the two points. Once the move is complete, the unit inflicts D3 S4 AP- hits per Reaver on one unengaged, non-vehicle unit that lies under the line, resolved immediately. Cover saves may be taken as normal.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
